data: {"type":"tool-input-available","toolCallId":"call_NdxyRG8Hd2bj4LMWcvZXfgMI","toolName":"addToNote","input":{"markdown":"## Salvation by Grace\n\n> “For by grace are ye saved through faith; and that not of yourselves: it is the gift of God:”  \n> —Ephesians 2:8 KJV\n\n> “Not of works, lest any man should boast.”  \n> —Ephesians 2:9 KJV\n\nThese verses complement Romans 8’s assurance: salvation rests on God’s gracious gift in Christ, received through faith, rather than on our works or grounds for boasting.","noteId":"","title":""},"providerMetadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_09bf6a91af855a1b006a7cb010bdd481a09ab5a9c1ad80b006"}}}

data: {"type":"tool-output-available","toolCallId":"call_NdxyRG8Hd2bj4LMWcvZXfgMI","output":{"noteId":"cmsqd5yew0001l1044xappbwo","noteTitle":"Untitled Note","appendedHtml":"<h2>Salvation by Grace</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“For by grace are ye saved through faith; and that not of yourselves: it is the gift of God:”<br>—Ephesians 2:8 KJV</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“Not of works, lest any man should boast.”<br>—Ephesians 2:9 KJV</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>These verses complement Romans 8’s assurance: salvation rests on God’s gracious gift in Christ, received through faith, rather than on our works or grounds for boasting.</p>","created":false},"providerMetadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_09bf6a91af855a1b006a7cb010bdd481a09ab5a9c1ad80b006"}}}

